{"sample_id":"latency-es-instances-scaling","topic":"ES Instances Scaling","messages":[{"speaker_name":"架构师Alpha","role":"architect","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":0,"content":"技能名：ES Instances Scaling，用于依据负载与分片状态安全调整 Elasticsearch 实例数量。"},{"speaker_name":"运维Gamma","role":"devops","ritual_signal":"supplement","round_number":1,"content":"使用 monitor_api、api_client 和 scaling_tool 检查 CPU、堆内存、分片分配与集群健康度。"},{"speaker_name":"开发Delta","role":"developer","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":2,"content":"步骤：1. 采集容量指标；2. 计算目标节点数；3. 分批扩缩容；4. 等待分片稳定；5. 验证查询延迟。"},{"speaker_name":"安全Beta","role":"security","ritual_signal":"challenge","round_number":3,"content":"禁止在集群红色状态继续变更，缩容前必须确认目标节点没有未迁移的主分片。"},{"speaker_name":"主持人","role":"moderator","ritual_signal":"summarize","round_number":4,"content":"共识类别为 automation，报告保留变更批次、健康状态、延迟指标和回滚证据。"}]}
{"sample_id":"latency-centos-rocky-migration","topic":"CentOS-Rocky Migration","messages":[{"speaker_name":"架构师Alpha","role":"architect","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":0,"content":"技能名称：CentOS-Rocky Migration，用于将停止维护的 CentOS 主机迁移到 Rocky Linux。"},{"speaker_name":"运维Gamma","role":"devops","ritual_signal":"supplement","round_number":1,"content":"使用 migration_toolkit、inventory_scanner 和 test_runner 盘点软件源、内核模块与业务依赖。"},{"speaker_name":"开发Delta","role":"developer","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":2,"content":"步骤：首先创建快照，然后迁移测试节点，执行兼容性回归，再按批次迁移生产主机。"},{"speaker_name":"安全Beta","role":"security","ritual_signal":"challenge","round_number":3,"content":"禁止无快照迁移；驱动、SELinux 策略或关键服务验证失败时立即恢复原系统。"},{"speaker_name":"主持人","role":"moderator","ritual_signal":"summarize","round_number":4,"content":"该 automation 技能以服务可用性、包版本一致性和回滚演练结果验收。"}]}
{"sample_id":"latency-resource-cost-governance","topic":"Resource Cost Governance","messages":[{"speaker_name":"产品经理","role":"pm","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":0,"content":"技能名：Resource Cost Governance，解决闲置实例、无主资源和预算异常的问题。"},{"speaker_name":"数据分析师","role":"data","ritual_signal":"supplement","round_number":1,"content":"使用 Cost Explorer、tag_inspector 和 report_generator 关联账单、标签与资源责任人。"},{"speaker_name":"运维Gamma","role":"devops","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":2,"content":"步骤：1. 拉取成本；2. 识别异常；3. 确认责任人；4. 执行缩容或关停；5. 记录节省额。"},{"speaker_name":"架构师Alpha","role":"architect","ritual_signal":"challenge","round_number":3,"content":"生产资源关停必须经过依赖检查，并为有状态服务保留快照和恢复路径。"},{"speaker_name":"主持人","role":"moderator","ritual_signal":"summarize","round_number":4,"content":"共识类别为 domain_knowledge，按月复核标签覆盖率、预算偏差和实际节省。"}]}
{"sample_id":"latency-monitoring-rollback","topic":"Monitoring Rollback","messages":[{"speaker_name":"运维Gamma","role":"devops","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":0,"content":"技能名称：Monitoring Rollback，用于监控规则或采集配置异常时快速恢复稳定版本。"},{"speaker_name":"分析师","role":"analyst","ritual_signal":"supplement","round_number":1,"content":"通过 Prometheus、Alertmanager、Grafana 和配置版本库对比错误率、丢数率与告警延迟。"},{"speaker_name":"开发Delta","role":"developer","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":2,"content":"步骤：1. 冻结继续发布；2. 定位异常版本；3. 恢复上一配置；4. 重载服务；5. 验证指标与告警链路。"},{"speaker_name":"安全Beta","role":"security","ritual_signal":"challenge","round_number":3,"content":"禁止删除故障配置和审计记录，回滚后仍需保留现场以完成根因分析。"},{"speaker_name":"主持人","role":"moderator","ritual_signal":"summarize","round_number":4,"content":"该 monitoring 技能以数据恢复、告警恢复、回滚耗时和变更证据验收。"}]}
{"sample_id":"latency-terraform-change-gate","topic":"Terraform Change Gate","messages":[{"speaker_name":"架构师Alpha","role":"architect","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":0,"content":"技能名：Terraform Change Gate，用于在基础设施变更执行前阻断高风险计划。"},{"speaker_name":"运维Gamma","role":"devops","ritual_signal":"supplement","round_number":1,"content":"使用 terraform plan、policy checker、cost estimator 和 drift detector 生成机器可审计的检查结果。"},{"speaker_name":"开发Delta","role":"developer","ritual_signal":"propose","round_number":2,"content":"步骤：首先生成 plan，然后检查删除与替换资源，评估成本和漂移，审批通过后才允许 apply。"},{"speaker_name":"安全Beta","role":"security","ritual_signal":"challenge","round_number":3,"content":"禁止绕过策略门禁；涉及网络边界、密钥或生产数据库的变更必须增加人工复核。"},{"speaker_name":"主持人","role":"moderator","ritual_signal":"summarize","round_number":4,"content":"共识类别为 automation，门禁报告记录计划哈希、策略结论、审批人与执行结果。"}]}
